  "fullDescription": "Bold and Easy Cozy Christmas Coloring Pages Bundle | KDP Interior- Volume – 3\n\nBold and Easy Cozy Christmas Coloring Book is the perfect holiday activity for all ages! Packed with festive, large-print illustrations designed to reduce stress and inspire creativity, this book offers a delightful way to unwind during the most wonderful time of the year.\n\nEach page features charming Christmas scenes—cozy fireplaces, jolly Santas, Christmas trees, and snowy landscapes—created with thick lines and simple shapes, making it easy to color for both beginners and experienced colorists. The designs are thoughtfully arranged to evoke the warmth and magic of the season, ensuring a joyful experience as you color your way through winter wonderlands.\n\nThis book is ideal for seniors, kids, and anyone who loves the holidays and wants a relaxing, cozy activity to celebrate. Whether you’re sipping hot cocoa by the fire or gathered with family and friends, this coloring book will add extra cheer to your Christmas season!\n\nInside this Bold and Easy Cozy Christmas Coloring Pages Bundle features over 175+ pages of heartwarming and charming Christmas-themed designs, perfect for creating a relaxing and festive holiday atmosphere. From cozy animals wrapped in scarves, warm mugs of hot cocoa, and snuggly Christmas sweaters to glowing fireplaces, twinkling lights, and peaceful snowy scenes, each page invites you to bring the cozy magic of Christmas to life with your creative flair. These designs are perfect for both beginner and experienced colorists seeking a calm, joyful escape into the comfort of the holiday season.\n\n175+ Bold and Easy Cozy Christmas Coloring Pages, Coloring Books, Coloring Pages, Printable Cozy Christmas Coloring Pages, Christmas Activity, All Ages Coloring Book\n\nPerfect for use as a KDP interior or as printable coloring pages, this bundle is versatile for all your creative needs. Simply download, print, and enjoy!\n\nYou will receive a .zip file containing all designs. These are in .EPS+ PDF + JPG + PNG + SVG Format Files.. 300 Dpi\n\n**Instant Digital Download.**\n\n**Interior Details:**\n\n👉 Dimensions: (8.5″ x 8.5″ Inches) (with bleed)\n👉 Black and White\n👉 175+ Coloring Pages\n👉 A high-quality final Pdf File print ready ( 300 Dpi )\n👉 A high-quality EPS Files\n👉 175+ high-resolution JPEG Format files (300 dpi)\n👉 175+ high-resolution PNG files (300 dpi) ( Transparent Background )\n👉 175+ high-resolution SVG files (300 dpi)\n👉 11+ Free Book Cover Backgrounds\n👉All images are high-quality 300 DPI, making them perfect for print\n\nThank You So Much For purchasing and welcome my store..🥰🥰🥰",
